#: build/adminPanel.js:171
msgid ""
"Defer off-screen images until they are near the viewport, reducing initial "
"page weight. Above-the-fold images are detected automatically and load "
"eagerly."
msgstr ""
"تأجيل تحميل الصور خارج الشاشة حتى تقترب من منطقة العرض، مما يقلل من حجم "
